# `fluid::Network`

The compiled, immutable pipe network.

## Signature

```cpp
fluid::Network
```

## Construction

Returned by `network`.

## Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`nodes`](Network/nodes.md) | The number of nodes. |
| [`junctions`](Network/junctions.md) | The number of junctions. |
| [`reservoirs`](Network/reservoirs.md) | The number of reservoirs. |
| [`tanks`](Network/tanks.md) | The number of tanks. |
| [`pipes`](Network/pipes.md) | The number of pipes. |
| [`pumps`](Network/pumps.md) | The number of pumps. |
| [`valves`](Network/valves.md) | The number of valves. |
| [`links`](Network/links.md) | The number of links: pipes plus pumps plus valves. |
| [`batch_shape`](Network/batch_shape.md) | The leading scenario axes shared by the physical arrays. |
| [`dtype`](Network/dtype.md) | The precision of the compiled arrays, `Float32` or `Float64`. |
| [`platform`](Network/platform.md) | The platform of the compiled arrays. |
| [`liquid`](Network/liquid.md) | The `Liquid` the network was compiled with. |

## Changelog

- **0.1**: initial documented surface.

